### =====================================================================
### Kraków bez barier — MVP e2e demo (VS Code "REST Client", humao.rest-client)
###
### 1. Start server:  uv run python main.py
### 2. Click "Send Request" above each block, top → bottom (requests pass ids along via @name).
### 3. Start again any time with step 0 (reset).
### =====================================================================

@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@anna = demo-anna
@jan = demo-jan
@ola = demo-ola
@piotr = demo-piotr
@marek = demo-marek
@admin = demo-admin
@ewa = demo-ewa
@public = http://localhost:8000/public/v1
@apiKey = demo-key

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### Health → storage: sql (SQLite, survives restart) | memory; auth_mode; ai_mode
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 0. Reset demo data (admin) → 204 (also wipes the SQLite DB back to seed)
POST {{base}}/admin/demo/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Demo login (optional — demo tokens are just "demo-<username>") → 200 {token, user}
POST {{base}}/auth/demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "anna"}

### Who am I → 200 role=user
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Search step-free places → plc_mnk, plc_ice
GET {{base}}/places?features=step_free_entrance

### 1b. Near me (Rynek Główny), nearest first with distance_m, 2 per page
GET {{base}}/places?lat=50.0617&lon=19.9373&page_size=2

### 1c. Map view: markers (accessible / partial / inaccessible) for the viewport
GET {{base}}/places?view=map&bbox=19.90,50.04,19.96,50.08

### 1d. Categories with counts (chips)
GET {{base}}/categories

### 1e. Search-box suggestions ("muz" → Muzeum Narodowe)
GET {{base}}/geocode?q=muz

### 400 VALIDATION_ERROR — sort=nearest without location
GET {{base}}/places?sort=nearest

### 1f. Similar places near the museum (same category first, then nearest)
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/similar?limit=3

### 1g. Route museum → office for a wheelchair (heuristic: helpers/barriers within 100 m)
GET {{base}}/routes/accessible?from=plc_mnk&to=plc_urzad&profile=wheelchair

### 1h. Same route for a blind person (tactile paths, kerbs)
GET {{base}}/routes/accessible?from=plc_mnk&to=plc_urzad&profile=blind

### 404 NOT_FOUND — route from unknown place
GET {{base}}/routes/accessible?from=nowhere&to=plc_urzad

### 1i. Filter by place type (venue / shop / public_transport_stop / platform / parking / office / …)
GET {{base}}/places?place_type=office

### 1j. "Partially accessible": Jan reports ICE entrance works only partly (value partial)
POST {{base}}/places/plc_ice/observations
Authorization: Bearer {{jan}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"feature": "ramp", "value": "partial", "comment": "Podjazd jest, ale stromy"}

### 1k. Temporary issue with end date: lift on ICE closed until tomorrow (valid_until)
POST {{base}}/places/plc_ice/observations
Authorization: Bearer {{ola}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"feature": "platform_elevator", "value": "no", "temporary": true, "valid_until": "2099-01-01T00:00:00+00:00"}

### 400 VALIDATION_ERROR — valid_until in the past
POST {{base}}/places/plc_ice/observations
Authorization: Bearer {{ola}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"feature": "platform_elevator", "value": "no", "valid_until": "2000-01-01T00:00:00+00:00"}

### 400 VALIDATION_ERROR — unknown place type
GET {{base}}/places?place_type=spaceport

### Feature dictionary (filters)
GET {{base}}/accessibility/features

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Place details
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk

### 2b. Accessibility → elevator: yes (seed, confidence 0.5)
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/accessibility

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Can I get in by wheelchair? → answer: yes
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/check?profile=wheelchair

### 3b. Other needs (F14): blind → yes (Braille / tactile paths)
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/check?profile=blind

### 3c. "Czy mogę wejść z psem?" → yes
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/check?profile=assistance_dog

### 3d. Urząd: deaf → yes (PJM interpreter); low vision → no (poor lighting)
GET {{base}}/places/plc_urzad/check?profile=deaf

### 3e. Urząd: low vision → no
GET {{base}}/places/plc_urzad/check?profile=low_vision

### 3f. Search: assistance dog + PJM interpreter → plc_urzad
GET {{base}}/places?features=assistance_dog_allowed,sign_language_interpreter

### 400 VALIDATION_ERROR — unknown profile
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/check?profile=teleport

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4a. Anna uploads a photo → 201 {id: ph_…, url}
# @name upload
POST {{base}}/uploads
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----DemoBoundary

------DemoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="winda.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./winda.png
------DemoBoundary--

### 4a-AI. AI suggestions for the photo → tags winda/awaria, suggested elevator / not_working / critical
### (AI_MODE=mock: deterministic; onnx: Phi-3.5 Vision; gemini: Google Gemini API → "model": "gemini";
###  any error/timeout/no key → mock. Check active mode: GET /health → ai_mode)
POST {{base}}/ai/image-tags
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"photo_ids": ["{{upload.response.body.$.id}}"], "place_id": "plc_mnk"}

### 4a-TXT. AI from text: "winda od dwóch tygodni nie działa" → elevator / no / temporary
POST {{base}}/ai/parse-text
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text": "Winda od dwóch tygodni nie działa, ale podjazd jest odśnieżony"}

### 4b. Anna reports broken elevator → 201, observation_ids[0]
# @name report
POST {{base}}/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "place_id": "plc_mnk",
  "element": "elevator",
  "current_state": "not_working",
  "severity": "critical",
  "nature": "temporary",
  "description": "Winda przy wejściu głównym nieczynna, kartka o awarii.",
  "photo_ids": ["{{upload.response.body.$.id}}"]
}

### 4b-ME. Anna: my reports → the report just sent
GET {{base}}/me/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}

### 4b-FAV. Anna saves the museum to favourites → 204 (idempotent)
PUT {{base}}/me/favorites/plc_mnk
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}

### 4b-FAV2. Anna's favourites → plc_mnk with verification badge
GET {{base}}/me/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}

### D1. Jan starts a draft ("Zapisz szkic") → 201 status draft, no observation
# @name janDraft
POST {{base}}/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{jan}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"place_id": "plc_ice", "draft": true, "description": "Coś nie tak z podjazdem"}

### D2. Jan completes the draft → 200
PATCH {{base}}/reports/{{janDraft.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jan}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"element": "ramp", "current_state": "not_working", "severity": "obstacle", "nature": "temporary", "description": "Podjazd zastawiony rowerami"}

### D3. Jan submits → 200 status submitted + observation
POST {{base}}/reports/{{janDraft.response.body.$.id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{jan}}

### 409 CONFLICT — submit twice
POST {{base}}/reports/{{janDraft.response.body.$.id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{jan}}

### 4b-MAP. Map layer: current problems in the city (one request) — Anna's elevator with severity critical
GET {{base}}/observations?value=no&current=true&since=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z

### 4b-MAP2. Map layer for a viewport (old town)
GET {{base}}/observations?bbox=19.93,50.055,19.95,50.07&limit=50

### 400 VALIDATION_ERROR — map layer with bad bbox
GET {{base}}/observations?bbox=1,2,3

### 4c. Elevator now: no, temporary, confidence 0.6
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/accessibility

### 4d. Active observations (alerts)
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/observations?feature=elevator
Authorization: Bearer {{jan}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5a. Jan confirms 👍
POST {{base}}/observations/{{report.response.body.$.observation_ids[0]}}/votes
Authorization: Bearer {{jan}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": 1}

### 5b. Ola confirms 👍
POST {{base}}/observations/{{report.response.body.$.observation_ids[0]}}/votes
Authorization: Bearer {{ola}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": 1}

### 5c. Piotr confirms 👍 → feature_state.confidence 0.9
POST {{base}}/observations/{{report.response.body.$.observation_ids[0]}}/votes
Authorization: Bearer {{piotr}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": 1}

### 5d. Check → answer: partial (get in, elevator broken)
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/check?profile=wheelchair

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6a. Marek says the elevator works → 201, creates conflict
# @name marek
POST {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/observations
Authorization: Bearer {{marek}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"feature": "elevator", "value": "yes", "comment": "Winda działa, sprawdzone rano."}

### 6b. Elevator: still no, validation CONFLICT
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/accessibility

### 6c. Admin: moderation queue → 1 conflict item
# @name queue
GET {{base}}/admin/queue?filter=conflict
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 6d. Admin: conflict detail (both observations, votes, photo)
GET {{base}}/admin/queue/{{queue.response.body.$.items[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7a. Admin confirms Marek → status approved, elevator yes, confidence 1.0, VALID
POST {{base}}/admin/queue/{{queue.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "confirm",
  "winning_observation_id": "{{marek.response.body.$.id}}",
  "comment": "Sprawdzone telefonicznie z muzeum."
}

### 7b. Check → answer: yes
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/check?profile=wheelchair

### 7c. History kept: Anna's observation REJECTED, not deleted (active=false shows all)
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/observations?feature=elevator&active=false

### 7d. Place screen: activity feed (admin decision, Marek, Anna's report …) — newest first
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/activity?limit=10

### 7e. Place screen: photo gallery (Anna's evidence photo)
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/photos

### 7f. Place details: verification block → "Potwierdzone dzisiaj", sources, confidence level
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk

### 7g. Admin dashboard tiles (reports today, open conflicts, low confidence, observations today)
GET {{base}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 7h. Audit trail of MNK: observations (incl. REJECTED), conflict detected → resolved
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/history
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 7i. Owner Ewa can read history of her place
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/history
Authorization: Bearer {{ewa}}

### 403 FORBIDDEN — regular user cannot read the audit trail
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/history
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}

### 7j. Confidence widget for MNK (overall + per group)
GET {{base}}/admin/places/plc_mnk/confidence
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 7k. Moderator comment on the (resolved) conflict
POST {{base}}/admin/queue/{{queue.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text": "Zadzwoniłem do muzeum — winda działa od rana."}

### 7l. Spam observation on Camelot (Marek) …
# @name spam
POST {{base}}/places/plc_camelot/observations
Authorization: Bearer {{marek}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"feature": "ramp", "value": "no", "comment": "asdasd"}

### 7m. … admin flags it → FLAGGED, excluded from trust (ramp back to yes)
POST {{base}}/admin/observations/{{spam.response.body.$.id}}/flag
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "spam"}

### 7n. Jan applies for ownership of ICE ("Jestem właścicielem")
# @name ownReq
POST {{base}}/owner/ownership-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{jan}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"place_id": "plc_ice", "justification": "Kierownik obiektu ICE"}

### 7o. Admin: pending ownership requests
GET {{base}}/admin/ownership-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 7p. Admin approves → Jan becomes owner of ICE
POST {{base}}/admin/ownership-requests/{{ownReq.response.body.$.id}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"approved": true}

### 7q. Recompute all states
POST {{base}}/admin/revalidate
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 409 CONFLICT — ownership request decided twice
POST {{base}}/admin/ownership-requests/{{ownReq.response.body.$.id}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"approved": false}

### 403 FORBIDDEN — non-admin dashboard
GET {{base}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{ewa}}

### 400 VALIDATION_ERROR — activity limit out of range
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/activity?limit=0

### =====================================================================
### F5 Open API (/public/v1) — external apps, X-Api-Key, 60 req/min per key
### =====================================================================

### P1. Public search step-free places → plc_mnk, plc_ice
GET {{public}}/places?features=step_free_entrance
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### P2. Public place
GET {{public}}/places/plc_mnk
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### P3. Flat accessibility (yes→true, no→false, unknown omitted); after 7a elevator = true
GET {{public}}/places/plc_mnk/accessibility
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### P4. Flat accessibility, partial data → only "ramp"
GET {{public}}/places/plc_camelot/accessibility
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### P5. Public check → partial (ICE: elevator broken)
GET {{public}}/places/plc_ice/check?profile=wheelchair
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 401 UNAUTHORIZED — public API without key
GET {{public}}/places

### 401 UNAUTHORIZED — app Bearer token is not an API key
GET {{public}}/places
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

