POST {{base}}/admin/queue/{{ownQueue.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"action": "confirm", "winning_observation_id": "{{ewaUpdate.response.body.$.items[0].id}}"}

### O9a. Owner profile + tiles
GET {{base}}/owner/me
Authorization: Bearer {{ewa}}

