### =====================================================================
### F8 OSM import — OpenStreetMap snapshot (data/osm_krakow_tauron.json) → open_data (0.6)
### MCP: Claude tool check_accessibility asks the Open API (see README → MCP)
### =====================================================================

### I1. Before import: "Tauron" unknown → items []
GET {{public}}/places?q=tauron
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### I2. Admin imports OSM → 18 points, 11 places created (wheelchair=limited → partial), 7 unnamed skipped
POST {{base}}/admin/imports
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"source": "osm_file"}

### I3. Now Tauron Arena stops are on the map (3 places)
# @name tauron
GET {{base}}/places?q=tauron

### I4. Can I get in by wheelchair? → yes (OSM wheelchair=yes, confidence 0.6)
GET {{base}}/places/{{tauron.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/check?profile=wheelchair

### I5. Observations show source open_data, author OpenStreetMap
GET {{base}}/places/{{tauron.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/observations

### I6. Import again → idempotent: places_created 0, observations 0
POST {{base}}/admin/imports
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"source": "osm_file"}

### 403 FORBIDDEN — non-admin import
POST {{base}}/admin/imports
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"source": "osm_file"}

### 400 VALIDATION_ERROR — unknown import source
POST {{base}}/admin/imports
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"source": "overpass_live"}

